# Byte-exact checkouts everywhere. This repository's regression surface is
# bit-locked: self-goldens, .npy fixtures, TSV schemas, canonical manifests,
# and content-hash provenance all promise exact bytes. Git EOL normalization
# (autocrlf defaults to true on Windows runners and dev boxes) silently
# rewrites text files at checkout and breaks every byte-locked comparison, so
# conversion is disabled for the whole tree.
* -text
